{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "libjpeg-turbo",
  "version": "3.2.0",
  "group": "web",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://github.com/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo/releases/download/3.2.0/libjpeg-turbo-3.2.0.tar.gz",
    "archive": "libjpeg-turbo-3.2.0.tar.gz",
    "source_dir": "libjpeg-turbo-3.2.0",
    "sha256": "6f30092cef9fb839779646608f4ee14ae3cbac989c47fa05e841b0841f09878e"
  },
  "dependencies": [],
  "build": {
    "system": "cmake",
    "cmake_args": [
      "-DENABLE_SHARED=ON",
      "-DENABLE_STATIC=ON",
      "-DWITH_SIMD=0",
      "-DWITH_TURBOJPEG=0",
      "-DWITH_JAVA=0",
      "-DWITH_TOOLS=0",
      "-DWITH_TESTS=0",
      "-DWITH_FUZZ=0"
    ],
    "env": {
      "CFLAGS": "-O2"
    }
  },
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": "roundtrip-static",
      "type": "compile-run",
      "source": "porting/tests/libjpeg_roundtrip.c",
      "cflags": [
        "-I@PORT_PREFIX@/include"
      ],
      "link_args": [
        "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libjpeg.a"
      ],
      "expect_stdout": "libjpeg_roundtrip_test: ok",
      "target_overrides": {
        "windows": {
          "cflags": [
            "-U_WIN32",
            "-U_WIN32_WCE",
            "-U__WIN32__",
            "-UWIN32",
            "-U__NT__",
            "-U_MSC_VER"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "roundtrip-shared",
      "type": "compile-run",
      "source": "porting/tests/libjpeg_roundtrip.c",
      "cflags": [
        "-I@PORT_PREFIX@/include"
      ],
      "link_args": [],
      "expect_stdout": "libjpeg_roundtrip_test: ok",
      "target_overrides": {
        "linux": {
          "link_args": [
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libjpeg.so"
          ]
        },
        "macos": {
          "link_args": [
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libjpeg.dylib"
          ],
          "env": {
            "CRT_CXX_RUNTIME_LINKAGE": "shared"
          }
        },
        "windows": {
          "cflags": [
            "-U_WIN32",
            "-U_WIN32_WCE",
            "-U__WIN32__",
            "-UWIN32",
            "-U__NT__",
            "-U_MSC_VER"
          ],
          "link_args": [
            "@PORT_PREFIX@/lib/libjpeg.dll.a"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "status": {
    "linux": "shared-pass",
    "macos": "shared-pass"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Added 2026-10-10 for Web Tranche 3B milestone B2: WebCore's JPEG decoder and the bundled Skia (SkJpegCodec uses jpeg_crop_scanline/jpeg_skip_scanlines) need libjpeg-turbo, not IJG libjpeg; WebKit's FindJPEG requires >= 1.5.2.",
    "First recipe with build.system cmake (tools/crt-port-build.py build_cmake_port: generated toolchain file naming the CRT wrappers, find roots limited to the port prefix and the sysroot, Linux and macOS hosts).",
    "WITH_SIMD=0: the SIMD code needs NASM on the build host; the portable C paths are used until a SIMD build is wanted (a performance item, not a correctness one). TurboJPEG, tools and tests are off: the WebKit consumers use the libjpeg API only.",
    "macOS shared tests run with CRT_CXX_RUNTIME_LINKAGE=shared (test-level env): the executable links libc.dylib, the libc every dylib of the port loads, instead of a second static libc.a (Mach-O two-level namespace: two malloc/pthread registries in one process)."
  ]
}
